      "worked_solution": "Edges are straight line segments that connect the vertices of a polyhedron. \n\nThe rectangular pyramid has $8$ edges in total, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14224244/assets/abe815ce03ef1e4cdbc483505d98c9eed5ada7b6899a7b2eb2280745d5f46208.png)",
